{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tin Lord</strong> is a dark strategy that combines base building, wave defense, and exploration of a star map filled with missions, events, and traders.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/e76c843fd1a7030fbb344eb64305bfe3.poster.avif?t=1760446493\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/e76c843fd1a7030fbb344eb64305bfe3.webm?t=1760446493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/e76c843fd1a7030fbb344eb64305bfe3.mp4?t=1760446493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control the last interstellar ship under the control of artificial intelligence, sending robots to restore destroyed planets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a series of environmental disasters and the collapse of human civilization, you are the only remaining AI, drifting in space with the surviving drones. Communication with the &quot;creators&quot; is lost. Systems are on the verge of failure. But the mission is not over yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore new worlds, make decisions, build and fight - all for the last chance to right the wrongs of the past.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/6283ad58cc10bf00c63b64d5d43c8d70.poster.avif?t=1760446493\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/6283ad58cc10bf00c63b64d5d43c8d70.webm?t=1760446493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/6283ad58cc10bf00c63b64d5d43c8d70.mp4?t=1760446493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Star map: each run is a unique route with different missions, events and traders.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time strategy: build a base, place turrets and defenses, manage resources and plan your actions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark post-apocalyptic world: the landscape dynamically changes due to the interaction of tiles. Your actions affect the ecological state of each planet.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defensive structures: build a variety of turrets - from simple ballistas to powerful cannons - and watch them destroy enemies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuous progress: collect shards, unlock new robots, skills and containers to move further into the galaxy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/93da9c37e25821bcd84357c672cbea3b.poster.avif?t=1760446493\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/93da9c37e25821bcd84357c672cbea3b.webm?t=1760446493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/93da9c37e25821bcd84357c672cbea3b.mp4?t=1760446493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Prepare for an intense strategic struggle for survival and restoration of the world, where every move you make can be decisive!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/9309e87fa7739d2f3fc78c479b9dee33.poster.avif?t=1760446493\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/9309e87fa7739d2f3fc78c479b9dee33.webm?t=1760446493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/9309e87fa7739d2f3fc78c479b9dee33.mp4?t=1760446493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3277010?t=1760446493","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/a6a8a3738036781a307bbab38b15516e02a3ecc3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760446493","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/103e8ba906bd32b8bc18c58a24ff7c244401b0e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760446493","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/103e8ba906bd32b8bc18c58a24ff7c244401b0e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760446493","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3934840,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tin Lord</strong> is a dark strategy that combines base building, wave defense, and exploration of a star map filled with missions, events, and traders.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/e76c843fd1a7030fbb344eb64305bfe3.poster.avif?t=1760446493\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/e76c843fd1a7030fbb344eb64305bfe3.webm?t=1760446493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/e76c843fd1a7030fbb344eb64305bfe3