powerful cannons - and watch them destroy enemies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuous progress: collect shards, unlock new robots, skills and containers to move further into the galaxy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/93da9c37e25821bcd84357c672cbea3b.poster.avif?t=1760446493\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/93da9c37e25821bcd84357c672cbea3b.webm?t=1760446493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/93da9c37e25821bcd84357c672cbea3b.mp4?t=1760446493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Prepare for an intense strategic struggle for survival and restoration of the world, where every move you make can be decisive!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/9309e87fa7739d2f3fc78c479b9dee33.poster.avif?t=1760446493\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/9309e87fa7739d2f3fc78c479b9dee33.webm?t=1760446493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/extras/9309e87fa7739d2f3fc78c479b9dee33.mp4?t=1760446493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["LegionSword"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277010/561c97165663ac50f8b889accfb742d4f3f81046/header.jpg?t=1760446493","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended"